    "np_faqs_3xV8Dg": {
      "type": "np-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_q9hxrF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is the Nodpod Sleep Mask different from other sleep masks?",
            "answer": "<p>There’s nothing like a Nodpod®. With its patented four-pod design, it applies gentle, calming pressure across your eyes and temples—no straps, no Velcro, just soft, weighted comfort that stays in place in any sleep position. It’s the original, one-of-a-kind sleep experience.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_y8y4gH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is the Nodpod BODY different from other weighted blankets?",
            "answer": "<p>Traditional weighted blankets can be bulky, leaving you feeling hot and trapped. Nodpod BODY’s patented design is compact, breathable, and body-hugging, delivering calming Deep Touch Pressure exactly where you need it. It’s fully machine washable and dryer safe, making stress relief easier than ever.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_e9CmUM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Nodpod if I sleep on my side, and will it stay on all night?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Nodpod was designed for side sleeping—and thanks to its strap-free design, it lays comfortably in any sleep position.</p><p>Nodpod is meant to help you <em>fall</em> asleep, not stay strapped to your face all night. Its gentle weight works naturally with your body to ease you into deep sleep without restriction.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_PXnzGf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I use Nodpod upright (like on a plane or sitting up)?",
            "answer": "<p>To wear Nodpod upright, insert the corner of one end tab through the slit on the opposing end tab. Then, place it over your head and adjust for a soft, secure fit. No Velcro, no straps—just hands-free, weighted comfort that stays in place while you rest upright.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_EQyMJA": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I care for my Nodpod, and can I chill it?",
            "answer": "<p>Nodpod is machine washable and scent-free. You can pop it in the freezer for a refreshing cool-down, it stays soft and flexible, never stiff. </p><p>The mask is also dual-sided: one side offers a warm, cozy feel, while the other stays cool to the touch for soothing versatility. Just please don’t microwave it!</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        }
      },
